### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Learn HTTP" }

### Create a task that is already done
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Read the plan", "done": true }

### ERROR 400: create with an empty title
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### ERROR 400: create with done as a string
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bad done", "done": "yes" }

### ERROR 400: create with broken JSON
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{bad

### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### List only finished tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?done=true

### Search tasks by title
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?q=learn

### Get one task
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1

### ERROR 404: get a task that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/99

### Replace a task (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Learn HTTP well", "done": true }

### ERROR 400: PUT without done
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Only a title" }

### ERROR 404: PUT on a missing task
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nothing here", "done": false }

### Update part of a task (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": false }

### ERROR 400: PATCH with nothing to change
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ERROR 400: PATCH with a wrong type
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": "yes" }

### ERROR 404: PATCH on a missing task
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/2

### ERROR 404: delete the same task again
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/2

### ERROR 404: unknown route
GET http://localhost:3000/nope